{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026lXPVH4YwZs1795822456.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國人工智能(AI)模型開發商OpenAI控告蘋果公司竊取商業機密，並施壓硬件供應商。</p><p></p><p>ChatGPT的開發商OpenAI入稟加州聯邦法院，指控蘋果聘請一名曾在OpenAI工作六個月的員工，從而取得機密資訊。OpenAI又指控蘋果施壓硬件供應商，阻止公司進軍硬件市場。</p><p></p><p>蘋果早前曾起訴OpenAI及其兩名員工，指控他們盜取商業機密，以幫助OpenAI進軍消費硬件市場。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T03:23:50.097525+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T23:33:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T15:33:59.030718+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T03:17:15.100687+00:00","content_hash":"37ebf828919238adc458808d3a3aee500c6dbef2335201ba431b299be4798adf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-28T03:23:50.097525+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}